"text": "[image: Rain, shine, and new and returning Eagles. We participated in EWU Neighborfest, walked Cheney in a coalition canvass with Karina Wallace (@karina_justfiguringitout), who is running for State Rep in the 9th LD. Go Team! Students, make your vote count HERE. Register online at VoteWA.gov through October 26, or in person through Election Day.]",
"href": "https://www.instagram.com/p/DeXJtCOiIYJ/"
},
{
"text": "[image: Thank you to our hosts, the Chases and Kuhlings, for inviting your friends to join us! A beautiful old living room, every chair filled, and neighbors who came ready with good questions and stayed long after the last one. Ballots arrive soon! If you would like to host a gathering like this before then, we would love to come: https://conroy4congress.com/volunteer]",
